ait-native public release source aggregate

This root assembles five independently versioned AIT authority Snapshots into
one public release source tree. It does not relicense any component.

Public source license map:

- root release controls and documentation: Apache-2.0
- `ait-core/**`: Apache-2.0
- `ait-runner/**`: Apache-2.0
- `ait-python/**`: Apache-2.0
- `ait-node/**`: Apache-2.0
- `ait-server/**`: AGPL-3.0-only

The root LICENSE states the default grant and the sole path exception. Each
component subtree retains its exact LICENSE and NOTICE. Root `LICENSES/`
contains complete reference copies of the two public license texts only.
